1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
So I want to talk to you today about the serendipity of human connection.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,500
Every day we make thousands of mundane decisions that seem trivial.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:13,000
But a subtle shift in perspective can precipitate a profound transformation.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
The ubiquity of smartphones has made this phenomenon even more pervasive.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
We often underestimate how tenuous our relationships really are.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,000
And yet, a candid conversation can alleviate the most persistent anxiety.

7
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:33,000
That is the crux of what I call genuine empathy.

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Let me be very candid about my own shortcomings here.

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:43,000
The magnitude of this problem should not be underestimated.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Thank you for your unwavering attention.
